"M4N1MKxe, M4N1MKye, M4N1MKze, M4N2MKxe, M4N2MKye, M4N2MKze" 		 - MB1 static (elastic) moments
"M5N1TDxss, M5N1TDyss, M5N1TDzss, M5N2TDxss, M5N2TDyss, M5N2TDzss" 		 - MB2 displacements
"M5N1RDxe, M5N1RDye, M5N1RDze, M5N2RDxe, M5N2RDye, M5N2RDze" 		 - MB2 rotations
